<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Aluar first half net $62.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine Aluar first half net $62.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31.</p>
<p>Net $62.8 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company did not provide EPS for the period.</p>
<p>The six month result included an extraordinary gain of $25.3 million.</p>
<p>Full company name is Aluar Aluminio Argentino.</p>
<p>((--Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
